---
description: llmmd repository navigation and reuse rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first.

Do not index or scan `outputs/`, `.venv/`, `.pytest_cache/`, or `__pycache__/` unless explicitly requested.

Use `docs/REPO_MAP.md` to choose the owner module before searching.

Launcher/process code belongs in `llmmd_core/`.
Launcher defaults belong in `config/llmmd.yaml`.
RAG settings belong in `rag_service/config.py` and `rag_service/ui_settings_store.py`.
Qdrant access belongs in `rag_service/store.py`.
Docker Qdrant lifecycle belongs in `llmmd_core/docker.py`.
OCR/Markdown conversion belongs in `gui/services/file_processing.py`.

Default verification: `python -m pytest -q`.
